Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.72,0:22:59.56,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}通往那勉强维系的明天  还请一定要跨越过去啊
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.40,0:23:02.77,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}那怠惰的祈愿
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.77,0:23:04.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}就连信心都没有
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.57,0:23:06.40,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}也不需要一决胜负
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.40,0:23:08.57,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}把电源彻底关掉吧
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.57,0:23:10.03,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}明天还要早起
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.03,0:23:11.74,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}却因胡思乱想无法入眠
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.74,0:23:14.16,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}嗯  向今天道一声再见
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.87,0:23:19.12,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}我爱着你  那一声呼唤
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.12,0:23:22.63,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}犹如潮汐周而复始  愈发令人心生怜爱
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.63,0:23:26.17,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}宛如施展了魔法一般  令我不禁再次回想起
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.17,0:23:31.14,EDCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord1\3c&H5A758A&\c&H5A758A&}那旅途中久违的温暖

